            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yobu AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri mu/aywaáts guri báy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iwa hhe'eés axweesantá dír Yobuwo, Elifási kuduú Temanmo guri báy, «Aníng muuna iga ló'wa gaás as kuúng nee hhaeewók kudá' tsár, asma axweesantá ganaa' aga axwesi'iiká daanduueene ar adór tidár sagadiyusmooeé' Yobu, ira axweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe awér faanqw slawaak nee gwaandaawér faanqwe, daqaní ta tleerá' amór sagadiyusmooeé' Yobu hikwaasíng ki ilahhooár da/a/ángw wá hanisá', as daandeemoohúng, Yobu kuungá' nu aleefirin, aníng firoorós a ya/aám, as kahhó' kuungá' munduwa alsihhiít as daktu'umarhúng tisíng, asma looeema iga kati'iiká daanduueene adoodár sagadiyusmooeé' Yobu ira axweés.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Elifasi kuduú Temanmo nee Bildadi kuduú Shuhitmo nee Sofari kuduú Na'amatmo nari tlayé', adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nga báy ngari tleehhiyé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ alefirór Yobu gari ya/án.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá Yobu mukdá' nguwa hhe'eés aleefirooro, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yobu guri adoodár aángí ki/ís, guri muruuwósí ki/ís sleémeero kuduú aáng ba/a sagáwa tsár wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yobu hhaeewós awa daaqaay nee awa dasuuwo, nguri i daqayé' nee mulqeerose. Mukdá' aáng Yobu gu xuú' tari amór do'ós i daqáy, tari al/ayín, nguri gurkwa/amisiyé' as slahh'amudá' yaariír aa sláy oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa dirós i huúw. Umuú heewo muqslidár peésa gana haniís nee mungoó wák oo sahaábuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ hotaá Yobu kukaá alu gina ak tsuúq ta kudaá geeraawo. Bee/ángw Yobu tari kume mibaá nee tsiyáhh, angamiarós a kume lahhoó', hikwa ngi kon kume tsár, nee daqwaayér /ameena a kumuú wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/iiwós awa daaqaay a faanqw, nee dasuuwós a tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dasirós ar ur umuuwós a Yemima, nee ar tsár a Kesia, nee ar tám umuuwós a Keren-hapuki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Keren-hapuki:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umuuwi gídaabaárós a hhooki.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá ayaadae dasuú hhohhó' oo slaqamís nee dasuú Yobu i kaahh, baabuuín Yobu giri aalírí haniís adór hhaeeín awa daaqáy wá ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá kaangwihe Yobu iri hoót ay kureeri tsiiruú wák nee mibeeri tsiyáhh, inós nángw naangós oo sagáwa tsiyáhh guri ár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yobu iri gwaá', inós a aakoó kureeraá yaariir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
